# Everything here executes on a plugin user's machine or decides what CI trusts.
# Require review on the surfaces where a small, quiet diff has the largest blast
# radius: the Go commands, the launcher that builds and execs them, the rules and
# their snapshots, the dependency tree, and CI itself.

/cmd/                @sourcec0de
/hookio/             @sourcec0de
/bin/                @sourcec0de
/hooks/              @sourcec0de
/.claude-plugin/     @sourcec0de
/astgrep/rules/      @sourcec0de
/bashguard/rules/    @sourcec0de
**/__snapshots__/    @sourcec0de
/vendor/             @sourcec0de
/go.mod              @sourcec0de
/go.sum              @sourcec0de
/flake.nix           @sourcec0de
/flake.lock          @sourcec0de
/.github/            @sourcec0de
